  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Build a Training Center: Transform a Community</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Tumaini Initiative is an innovative year-long technical textile design and self-development business training program that will over 5 years enable 180 people across 4 areas of Kenya to start their journey out of generational poverty. Individuals will be certified in a market demand skill set and placed into ethical jobs with us or with one of our vetted partners, allowing them to take that first step towards financial and social stability.</narrative>
  </description>
